  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Analyse, Act, Amplify: Political engagement and collaboration to translate evidence to policy action.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partnership under the What Works Hub for Global Education will drive political engagement and collaboration to translate research and evidence into effective actions at country, regional and global levels, with a particular focus on improving the education workforce and delivery, resulting in more impactful and effective education reforms and therefore better education for marginalized girls and boys.</narrative>
  </description>
